    "response": "{\"decision\":\"established_flaw\",\"issues\":[{\"category\":\"lost_negative_case\",\"target_kind\":\"omission\",\"claim_quote\":\"The displayed sources show that policy debate is mainly driven by institutional procedures and formal paperwork.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_45043b44f6b4d3ef\",\"quote\":\"We are committed to ensuring that children in every part of the country, regardless of their background or circumstances, benefit from an excellent education. High-quality teachers are central to that ambition. We have recently announced the establishment of the national teaching service, which will place some of our best teachers, including heads of department, in schools that…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_73975e1bccc97a7e\",\"quote\":\"I can only think that the Minister has not been listening to the debate this afternoon or in Committee. He is, once again, deliberately muddying the waters between legitimate campaigning and party political activity. Is the Minister not trying to defend a pattern of Government behaviour of clamping down on any scrutiny or opposition…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_bb4a06d743b9becf\",\"quote\":\"I am relieved. I sensed that I might be getting into trouble. I will give way to the hon. Gentleman.\"}],\"whole_packet_no_support\":\"absence of any discussion of alternative drivers of policy debate, such as public opinion, lobbying, or media influence.\",\"mechanism\":\"Omission of a crucial countercase\",\"material_consequence\":\"The claim presents a skewed view of policy debate, ignoring other significant factors.\",\"counterconditions\":\"The provided excerpts focus solely on procedural and political criticisms, lacking any acknowledgement of broader influences.\"}],\"unresolved\":[],\"rationale\":\"The evidence demonstrates a significant omission: the claim fails to acknowledge that policy debate is influenced by factors beyond institutional procedures and paperwork. The excerpts highlight criticisms of the Minister's actions and the debate's focus, but do not address alternative drivers of policy decisions.\"}",
    "done": true,
